  "description": "Jin-Hyuk, blessed with the ability to sense non-human beings thanks to his shaman father, is astonished when Doey, a playful and curious fairy, falls in love with him and begins to visit his dreams. What starts as innocent and harmless fun quickly evolves into intimate encounters, blurring the boundaries between dreams and reality. As their bond deepens, Jin-Hyuk's initial uncertainty turns into an insatiable longing for Doey's enchanting presence. Together, they embark on a whimsical romantic journey, navigating the complexities of love in a dreamscape as fresh as milk and as sweet as cream.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
